# Needs the dev test stock (TST) in a test save.
name after a gap down the order fills at the lower daily price, not the limit
set-price TST 100
run-days 1
remember TST
show-buy TST
click FinanceOverhaulOrderTabLimit
type FinanceOverhaulShareAmountField 4
type FinanceOverhaulLimitPriceField 90
click Button
set-price TST 70
run-days 1
expect-log at 70 (limit 90) for 280
expect-owned-delta TST 4
cleanup:
cancel-new-orders
sell-back TST 4
set-price TST 100
close-dialog
